<section class="section section--ruled" aria-label="Specialisms">
  <div class="wrap grid-auto" style="--min:380px;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,88px)">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start">
      <span class="ico-ring"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 54 54" fill="none" stroke="#D62839" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="27" cy="13" r="3.4" fill="#D62839" /><path d="M26 20 V31 H35 L39 40 M20 26 H31 M22 36 a8 8 0 1 0 11 -7" /></svg></span>
      <h2 class="h-sm" style="margin:22px 0 16px">Accessible travel, planned honestly.</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:17.5px;color:var(--slate-2);max-width:520px">One of our Sprinters is wheelchair-accessible. For every request, Rezo talks through your needs first, then checks each stop before it goes into your itinerary. If something isn’t possible, he’ll say so — and suggest what is.</p>
      <a href="/accessible-travel" class="lnk">Accessible travel in Georgia <span aria-hidden="true" class="red">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start">
      <span class="ico-ring"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 54 54" fill="none" stroke="#D62839" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="27" cy="27" r="22" /><path d="M34 20 L30 31 L20 34 L24 23Z" /></svg></span>
      <h2 class="h-sm" style="margin:22px 0 16px">Where the road gets interesting.</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:17.5px;color:var(--slate-2);max-width:520px">A shorter 4×4 Sprinter and Rezo’s knowledge of Georgia’s back roads open up mountain valleys, high passes and villages that ordinary vans leave out. Road and weather conditions shape every mountain plan.</p>
      <a href="/adventure-4x4" class="lnk">4×4 adventure in Georgia <span aria-hidden="true" class="red">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .ico-ring { display: inline-flex; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
</style>
